            "@id": "ihh:NAI-S-0013"
          },
          "ihh:quote": "His reputation in athletics prompted an invitation by McGill to take on the post of Instructor in Gymnastics. The Minutes of the Board of Governors document his appointment in 1888, and the continuation of this appointment in 1889.",
