        },
        {
          "ihh:source": {
            "@id": "ihh:NAI-S-0009"
          },
          "ihh:quote": "1895: Moves to Denver to become PE director at the YMCA where he'll stay until 1898. At the same time he is attending the University of Colorado Medical School (Gross Medical College) and graduates in 1898.",
