      "ihh:notes": "Conflicting: the McGill University Archives statement on the KU exhibit (NAI-S-0013) and DCB (NAI-S-0018, 'Following graduation in 1887 (ba in mental and moral philosophy)') give 1887; KU Spencer finding aid (NAI-S-0017) says 'Naismith received his B.A. in Physical Education from McGill in 1883'. DCB also gives McGill entry as 1882 ('enrolled in Montreal's McGill College in 1882') against the McGill registrar card (sessions 1883 to 1887). A person decides.\nRuling 2026-10-16 (owner rule: a primary record decides; CONFLICTS.md): B.A. 1887 decided by the McGill Annual calendar 1887-1888 ('SESSION 1886-7 ... PASSED FOR THE DEGREE OF B.A. In Honours ... NaIsvITH, JAMES') and the 1888-1889 graduates list ('Naismith, James (P2), Almonte, O...... 1887'). Released from conflicting; the KU '1883' is not used. McGill entry: autumn 1883 (Annual calendar 1884-1885, session 1883-4 First Year); DCB's 1882 is not used."
